      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CHEER CHEER (4) comes off a moderate effort last start, finishing fourth at Warragul over 400m behind Smoke And Ash (23.05). Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings three times from four attempts. Looks the one to beat on his best form. JUST VINCENT (1) is a Cheryl Morris-trained newcomer by Kinloch Brae out of Fair Of Face with no trial form to work with. Drawn to get every chance. Respect any moves in the market. DIRTY NALA (6) has been in super consistent form, finishing in the minors at her last seven runs. Last time finished 2nd over 435m at this track beaten 4.5 lengths (24.94) behind Jolanna in a Maiden on November 8. The form out of her last race has been franked. Expected to be in the finish again. CHASING UNICORNS (8) can sneak into the finish.",
